{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fb813f81-7839-87aa-9d9a-7949920c2b20",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T10:48:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Bottom line first: do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts putting up a fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good question. Let me get a little more detail so I can point you the right way. What kind of fence, and where is the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 397 Gidley Street. Cedar. About four and a half feet tall. It's for the vegetable garden, out back. The deer keep eating everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, they're relentless. So it's around the garden only, or along the property line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think around the garden. But part of it runs near the back line. Is that different? I thought if it's under a certain height you don't need anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a common thing people hear, and it can depend. Generally a fence does need a permit in Newport, and the rules on height and distance from the property line come into play. Since yours is close to the back line, I'd want someone to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's a yes? I'm sorry, I'm not following. Is it the garden part or the fence part that matters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the fence. Doesn't matter that it's a garden fence. Most fences need a permit, so the safe answer is yes, apply before the contractor starts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the guy, he said he'd just start after the holidays. Does he pull it or do I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one can. Often the contractor does it, but the homeowner is the one responsible, so ask him whether he's including it. If he says it's not needed, I'd check with us first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Now another thing. Does the finished side have to face out? He said the nice side goes toward the neighbors, but my sister-in-law says it's the other way around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically the finished side faces outward, toward the neighbor or the street, with the posts and rails on your side. But I'd confirm that when you apply, because I don't want to tell you wrong on the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So out. The pretty side out. Wait, but with cedar slats is there even a pretty side? Both sides look the same to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair point. If it's a board-on-board or a flat style, it may look the same both ways. If there's a frame showing, that's the side that faces in. The inspector can sort it out with your plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I'm still a little fuzzy, but the permit part I got. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:46:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes on the permit. Do you have a sketch of where the fence goes? Even a rough drawing with measurements to the property lines helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can draw something. When can I bring it in? I'm going to Boston this Friday for a concert, so I'd like to do it before that, or else it's after the new year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open today and through the week, though the office may have shortened hours around Christmas. If you come in Tuesday or Wednesday you'd be fine. Bring the sketch, the height, and the material, and the contractor's name if you have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Contractor's name, okay. Is there a form I fill out or do you hand it to me there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We have the application here at the counter, and I believe you can find it on the city website too. Either way, someone will go over it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And do I call you back if I have more questions? What was your name again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anita. Zoning and Inspections. Just call this number and ask for the department. Do you want me to note your phone number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Permit, drawing, pretty side out. Well, maybe. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T10:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Have a good week, and enjoy the concert."
    }
  ],
